{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117248175618887681"]}, "author_id": "2362621202", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:31:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117248183940333753"], "id": "2117248183940333753", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117126320962351277", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Jason Calacanis says he spends under $40K a year on AI and gets $2M+ in value back.\n\nEveryone is quoting the 50x. That's the wrong number.\n\nThe real number is this one: his team says it has automated at least 7 full-time jobs and become about 2x faster at the average task.\n\nSo https://t.co/IGEcpkn8Gh https://t.co/K29XxON8gr", "url": "https://x.com/kay_eth1989/status/2117248183940333753"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116142504110178304"]}, "author_id": "2111452957099069442", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:30:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117247861381370348"], "id": "2117247861381370348", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114737429517062612", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Shop closes at 6. Customer texts don't.\n\nHow we'd set it up for a small shop: through @messagebird, a text, WhatsApp, Apple Messages or email can start a Grok Bot routine, and every reply waits as a draft.\n\nYou approve it with your morning coffee.\n\nhttps://t.co/TP830YhvoM https://t.co/cLwBwhsoiI https://t.co/b2gWVJRuUR", "url": "https://x.com/hallway247/status/2117247861381370348"}, {"article": {"title": "Grok Bot Agents: from zero to a working AI team in 10 Steps (Full Course)"}, "author_id": "1686744883556474880", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:26:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117247064669138981"], "id": "2117247064669138981", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/rf4eg3rvK4", "url": "https://x.com/0xClodex/status/2117247064669138981"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117246042689122305"]}, "author_id": "2100625557943701505", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:23:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117246265192759495"], "id": "2117246265192759495", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2110623034021212302", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "$75 → $7,719. AND THE BOT STILL ASKED “KEEP GOING?”\n\nThat question is the whole reason I made this Grok Bot.\n\n05:40. Starting balance: $75.\n12:27. Final balance: $7,719.\n\nFour bots run the desk. Every entry has to clear them in order:\n\nScanner checks fresh Solana pools and https://t.co/B76k4TYF5r https://t.co/b7VZ6cOJ5r", "url": "https://x.com/Noxen_of/status/2117246265192759495"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117246238667988992"]}, "author_id": "1428851633518104583", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:23:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117246242195419420"], "id": "2117246242195419420", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I had a Grok @bot tracking all my friends who did the NYC marathon yesterday. Not only was this easier and less annoying, I was also the most aware of where everyone was.\n\nAll I did was tell my main bot:\n“Hey I have some friends running the nyc marathon I need you to create a bot https://t.co/j9WcPCtlhI", "url": "https://x.com/henry_hobin/status/2117246242195419420"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117245240994385920"]}, "author_id": "1519066468633047040", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:23:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117246241004540328"], "id": "2117246241004540328", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 46, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117237874412175847", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "🤖 I use Grok Bot and it's just as advertised. A personal assistant! Or should I say, several assistants.\n\n👁️ I use a Grok Bot to help me sort through new followers so I can remove bots / fake / malicious accounts daily.\n\nIt can also scan all your followers looking for fake Elon https://t.co/CfwqCPZQzS https://t.co/KmyVy3i0KA", "url": "https://x.com/bruce_mcgonigal/status/2117246241004540328"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117246087467569153"]}, "author_id": "1519974714038534146", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:23:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117246198771822875"], "id": "2117246198771822875", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 39, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114393316158537843", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "WALLSTREET LEVEL GROK BOT FOUND A 9 SECOND GAP BETWEEN BINANCE AND POLYMARKET. I GAVE IT $400 AND WENT TO SLEEP.\n\nFor the first 132 minutes it didn't place a single bet.\n\nBy 7am the account was $3,058.\n\nHere's the gap. Polymarket runs a new \"Up or Down\" market every 15 minutes https://t.co/WHhYVK3mom https://t.co/fbimEqikY9", "url": "https://x.com/0xMiraqle/status/2117246198771822875"}, {"article": {"title": "How to Build a 24/7 AI Trading Desk With Grok Bot + Jev (Full Course) "}, "author_id": "1754421541389873152", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:23:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117246156241621361"], "id": "2117246156241621361", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/exm2IJl8Vi", "url": "https://x.com/RDV1113/status/2117246156241621361"}, {"author_id": "854669606249693184", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:22:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117245989115559995"], "id": "2117245989115559995", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1547059723811229696", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117235279753031939", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@HeyAbhishek grokbot in workflow automation, claude in coding. accurate tbh", "url": "https://x.com/SamuraiPhonk/status/2117245989115559995"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117239474698481664"]}, "author_id": "1541921466144489472", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:21:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117245758642536463"], "id": "2117245758642536463", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 57, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115477534548664379", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "$24.86 got us 112 new premium X followers.\n\nThat's $0.22 per follow. And I wasn't the one who found it.\n\nI set up my Grok Bot to test 50+ X ad variations. This video ad is converting the best.\n\nNotice what's different?\n\nNew followers aren't just a vanity metric. Growing your https://t.co/GJBmt2sgmP https://t.co/40HzBu1SQO", "url": "https://x.com/bradsmith/status/2117245758642536463"}, {"author_id": "1240434426305294343", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:21:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117245610516504894"], "id": "2117245610516504894", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1240434426305294343", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117245608654209059", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "⚠️ 风险提示\n\n1️⃣ Grok Bot：后台 routine 会把周额度提前烧光\n额度收紧以后，高频定时任务最先撞墙。超了以后如果开着 on-demand，会继续按量扣钱，而且没有「到百分比就停」的选项，要设消费上限只能自己去设置里改。觉得扣费不对，官方渠道是在 app 里反馈或发邮件到 support@x.ai。\n\n2️⃣", "url": "https://x.com/DissipativeS/status/2117245610516504894"}, {"author_id": "1240434426305294343", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:21:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117245608654209059"], "id": "2117245608654209059", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1240434426305294343", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117245606779318757", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "💡 今日技巧（官方文档核实）\n\n1️⃣ codex resume --last 只找当前目录，找不到时加 --all\nCLI 文档写明：resume --last 默认只在当前工作目录的会话里找「最近一个」。换了目录再跑，就会接上错的会话，或者提示没有。\n· 跨目录接着干：codex resume --last --all\n·", "url": "https://x.com/DissipativeS/status/2117245608654209059"}, {"author_id": "1240434426305294343", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:21:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117245604023636144"], "id": "2117245604023636144", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1240434426305294343", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117245601372868665", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "🤖 Grok Bot：额度突然收紧，Elon 亲口承认成本扛不住\n\n这两天（北京时间 11/1 起）大量用户反馈：Grok Bot 的周额度轻度使用也一下跳到 100%。\n\n我核过的情况：\n· 北京时间 11/2 04:34，有人问 Elon 能不能给 Grok Bot 也来次 reset，Elon 回：「The cost of serving Grok Bot was unsustainably high", "url": "https://x.com/DissipativeS/status/2117245604023636144"}, {"article": {"title": "Lauren Tan spent 28 days promoting two things. They're really one."}, "author_id": "1639105663904145409", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:18:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117244959707505151"], "id": "2117244959707505151", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Lauren Tan (@poteto) spent 28 days promoting two things: Grok Bot and pstack, her rules for how software should get built.\n\nThey're really one story. The rules that build the product ship inside it. https://t.co/EbaUi046CI", "url": "https://x.com/ChrisTranGG/status/2117244959707505151"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117151511713095680"]}, "author_id": "1324183584282939392", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:17:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117244782141452676"], "id": "2117244782141452676", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 280, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I just had my Grok Bot call a resort for me! The most mind-blowing part? When the automated menu picked up, Grok Bot pressed the numbers on its own and got through to a real person. 🤯\n\nWe're planning a trip and I had two questions: Is the waterpark included with a room? Can we https://t.co/1mCPkjnNU2", "url": "https://x.com/Texas_Twins_Dad/status/2117244782141452676"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117243292488208385"]}, "author_id": "1323811054250577921", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:12:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117243327158366331"], "id": "2117243327158366331", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117033967782113327", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Good crews don't save the punch list for the last day.\n\nThey knock out a few items every day, because the customer already told them what's wrong.\n\nThat's how Grok Bot is getting built. Fixes landing seven days a week off user feedback. Same rule works for any small business: https://t.co/DvrrKxLcVB https://t.co/yGQO5yRgEk", "url": "https://x.com/RobertKos11/status/2117243327158366331"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117242994525085696"]}, "author_id": "3235156716", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:10:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117243035000111613"], "id": "2117243035000111613", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI is writing more than ever. Review didn't get faster.\n\nThat's the debate on my timeline today: more code and more drafts, same amount of work actually shipped.\n\nIf that's true, the fix isn't a faster bot. It's a bot that hands you less to check.\n\nHere's the self-check I'd bolt https://t.co/wy52O01k0a", "url": "https://x.com/Max_XuY/status/2117243035000111613"}, {"author_id": "2005104706386018304", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:08:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117242482975244364"], "id": "2117242482975244364", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1699591741043527680", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117239211892084908", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@jackfriks don't have automated news gather for that , how could u not know that 😶\n\nu set that up grok bot , hermes or any Ai tools for that matter .", "url": "https://x.com/imshreekumar/status/2117242482975244364"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117241726649716736", "3_2117241726666481664", "3_2117241726662324224", "3_2117241726662332416"]}, "author_id": "1709939827486162944", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:05:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117241795583119692"], "id": "2117241795583119692", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Frankfurt, thank you 🙌 \nGreat builders and even better conversations at #GrokBot x Build Days AI Week. We built an #AISRE and a #softwarefactory live and left excited about what's next. \nBuild your own: https://t.co/PIFmnPILZg https://t.co/ICKmu4Nl77", "url": "https://x.com/glassflowdev/status/2117241795583119692"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117241498357895168", "3_2117241498349486081", "3_2117241498357915648", "3_2117241498357948417"]}, "author_id": "456558463", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:04:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117241505819549898"], "id": "2117241505819549898", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Our ESPN Fantasy Hockey newsletter, built entirely by Grok Bot 🤯🏒 Uptown League is a season-long points league, every point counts. Grok Bot pulls the stats daily and writes standings, trade follow-ups and weekly awards. Absolutely fantastic! #FantasyHockey #NHL\n\n@elonmusk https://t.co/Xsw2Wr0I2Y", "url": "https://x.com/LantzRichard/status/2117241505819549898"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:04:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117241385707254238"], "id": "2117241385707254238", "in_reply_to_user_id": "369865544", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 53, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117241343898419358", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@HectorCastro_09 @AlexFinn Sending this to your Grok Bot now so it can dig into the details for your workflow.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2117241385707254238"}, {"author_id": "2113842436212723712", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:02:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117241059189174505"], "id": "2117241059189174505", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Running a fleet of AI bots? Usage is what quietly runs out.\n\nUsage Bot checks your Grok Bot usage three times a day, logs which bot and routine is spending it, and asks bots to slow down before you hit the limit.\n\nIt only recommends. It never spends or edits your other bots.", "url": "https://x.com/OutworkVentures/status/2117241059189174505"}, {"article": {"title": "Grok Bots got throttled, how to keep them running"}, "author_id": "908438330249015296", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:00:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117240410347012374"], "id": "2117240410347012374", "public_metrics": {"bo